-- Spells aimed at a place or an item (phase 13: app/SpellTargetingScreens, app/TargetingWindows): the bar shown while a
-- spell waits for its target, the touch version of the desktop's targeting cursor. English, VanillaDroid's own texts
-- only: the questions before an enchantment are the client's (BIND_ENCHANT, REPLACE_ENCHANT), the errors too
-- (SPELL_FAILED_BAD_TARGETS, SPELL_FAILED_OUT_OF_RANGE). Syntax and rules: see common.lang.

VD_TARGETING_PLACE = "Tap the ground to place it, the circle to cast"; -- Blizzard, bombs, Flare...
VD_TARGETING_ITEM = "Choose an item"; -- poisons, sharpening stones, enchanting, Disenchant, Feed Pet
VD_TARGETING_LOCKED = "Choose a locked box or object"; -- Pick Lock, Disarm Trap
VD_TARGETING_CAST = "Cast"; -- the bar's button: casts at the circle
